      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the source manga layout with exactly three horizontal panels and six empty white speech balloons.\n<Picture 2> is character A's reference image.\n<Picture 3> is character B's reference image.\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion] Fill the three panels with a finished monochrome Japanese manga story. Retain the panel frames and all six empty balloons.\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: partially_preserved - keep the panel borders, white margins and all six blank balloons with their positions, sizes and tails.\n<Picture 2>: attribute_transfer - character A's face, hairstyle and clothing.\n<Picture 3>: attribute_transfer - character B's face, hairstyle and clothing.\ndetailed_description:\nStrictly black, white and gray ink manga with screentones. Read panels from top to bottom.\n{a}\n{b}\n{c}\nDraw around and behind the existing empty white balloons. Keep exactly two balloons in each panel. Do not add lettering, captions, page numbers or extra balloons. Nothing crosses the panel frames. A static single page.\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "f_string": "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the source manga layout with exactly three horizontal panels and six empty white speech balloons.\n<Picture 2> is character A's reference image.\n<Picture 3> is character B's reference image.\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion] Fill the three panels with a finished monochrome Japanese manga story. Retain the panel frames and all six empty balloons.\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: partially_preserved - keep the panel borders, white margins and all six blank balloons with their positions, sizes and tails.\n<Picture 2>: attribute_transfer - character A's face, hairstyle and clothing.\n<Picture 3>: attribute_transfer - character B's face, hairstyle and clothing.\ndetailed_description:\nStrictly black, white and gray ink manga with screentones. Read panels from top to bottom.\n{a}\n{b}\n{c}\nDraw around and behind the existing empty white balloons. Keep exactly two balloons in each panel. Do not add lettering, captions, page numbers or extra balloons. Nothing crosses the panel frames. A static single page.\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
